  "question": {
    "text": "If one strand of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DNA</mi></math> has sequence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ATCGTATG</mi></math>, the sequence in the complementary strand would be"
  },
